```

---

# 37. COMMON REPORTING MISTAKES

### Mistake 1

Finding without evidence.

### Mistake 2

Severity without justification.

### Mistake 3

Technical jargon for executives.

### Mistake 4

No remediation guidance.

### Mistake 5

No scope information.

### Mistake 6

Exposing credentials in screenshots.

### Mistake 7

Reporting scanner output as confirmed exploitation.

### Mistake 8

Not documenting limitations.

